    "draftDeletionMessage" : {
      "comment" : "Mac: message of the alert before deleting a draft ('draft' is the GitHub term for an item that exists only on the project board). %(title)@ is the draft's title. Also: iPhone and iPad: message of the alert that asks before deleting a draft (a GitHub project draft: an issue that exists only on the board). %(title)@ is the draft's title.",
