      "comment" : "List of changes waiting to be sent to GitHub (Mac: popover of the sync line at the bottom of the sidebar; iPhone, iPad: Queued Changes screen), next to the issue's number. Also quoted in a warning when GitHub refused the change. An Inbox notification was archived (GitHub calls this 'Done').",
